1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Customers see 503 at checkout; the order status is uncertain.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Browser packet enters gateway and selects a checkout endpoint.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Terminating pod still receives traffic while readiness is stale.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Readiness fails first; connections drain before pod termination.

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Idempotency key protects POST /checkout from duplicate orders.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Trace request IDs, watch 5xx, drain behavior, and order uniqueness.
